"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It’s the city that gave birth to The Beatles, inspired Gerry to ride that ferry, and spawned Bunnymen and Atomic Kittens. Now with all eyes – and ears – on Liverpool for the 2023 Eurovision Song Contest, a look into the BBC’s archives for a selection of performances from some of Merseyside’s biggest and best-loved musical stars.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":651714,\"title\":\"Dio: The Singles Collection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yjEI4OnKX2m7OCbvzPjPTvuteIq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l9ZViNrXfzaE1RR6Q2g7CQbQsGB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A collection of conceptual videos that defined the legendary career of Ronnie James Dio and Dio.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":496,\"title\":\"Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7g9kBHMN2KTr5KUf8aen187Mdn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mEagEZkyUp18shDqX05w4zxTnEM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kazakh journalist Borat Sagdiyev travels to America to make a documentary. As he zigzags across the nation, Borat meets real people in real situations with hysterical consequences. His backwards behavior generates strong reactions around him exposing prejudices and hypocrisies in American culture.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":344340,\"title\":\"3-D Rarities\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6LtDeROzBVYK9aYIXwV8zMFR4rk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t6N3u33epGunp4keSMqvMpwRTn3.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Selections include Kelley's Plasticon Pictures, the earliest extant 3-D demonstration film from 1922 with incredible footage of Washington and New York City; New Dimensions, the first domestic full color 3-D film originally shown at the World’s Fair in 1940; Thrills for You, a promotional film for the Pennsylvania Railroad; Stardust in Your Eyes, a hilarious standup routine by Slick Slavin; trailer for The Maze, with fantastic production design by William Cameron Menzies; Doom Town, a controversial anti-atomic testing film mysteriously pulled from release; puppet cartoon The Adventures of Sam Space, presented in widescreen; I’ll Sell My Shirt, a burlesque comedy unseen in 3-D for over 60 years; Boo Moon, an excellent example of color stereoscopic animation…and more!\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":75584,\"title\":\"Boogeymen: The Killer Compilation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7qCqZHiCdBa6mFJ7aUyuHPPHkJg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A compilation of clips from seventeen classic slasher films.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":3579,\"title\":\"Shadow Realm\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nFvYaCMvl4UycZmq2kLSE4QAUyB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shadow Realm is a compilation of two episodes planned for the short-lived Fox Network television series Night Visions. Each episode contained two stories and were originally hosted by musician/actor/writer Henry Rollins. The Sci-Fi Channel acquired the rights to broadcast the episodes, including the last three unaired episodes and strung two of them together as an anthology movie. Title sequences and end credits were changed and the Henry Rollins introductions were removed from the final product.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":275338,\"title\":\"Elvis Through the Years\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xcEW4cCJKgKYSRu7R9j2r3Gy1zw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This documentary offers an unparalleled behind-the-scenes look at the life of Elvis Presley. Using rare footage from his films, press conferences, outtakes, movie trailers, news clips, and comedy sketches, Elvis Thru the Years is a fitting commemoration of the man who became a legend.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1040014,\"title\":\"Frankie Goes to Hollywood: Frankie Say Greatest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5lHXWP68uqTQwfcQDDnZlnXG4Wc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Collection of greatest videos by Frankie Goes to Hollywood.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1708755,\"title\":\"My Father's Table\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/35Klkt9GqUbkyeILt8jDWM8VPzG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cpNRNYXg8Y0ffufzU1nB81zhUQI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A wife diagnosed with a condition that stops her from cooking! Cooking for the first time in his life is hard enough... But penalty points if it tastes bad, and 10 points mean DIVORCE?!\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1708756,\"title\":\"Lovely Death\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mX87jbXAUqm9mhcMUVVDtFq3ZoL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three friends determined to die are denied by death itself and sent to uncover the truth behind a mass poisoning at Hongpyeong Pension. As hidden secrets and suspicions emerge among the survivors gathered there, Yeon begins to cling desperately to life, causing a painful rift with Irim, who still longs for them to die together. When the true killer finally strikes again, Yeon barely survives, forever marked by death’s shadow.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}